155	    /**
156	     * A pragmatic syntactic email check: a non-empty local part, an {@code @}, and a domain that
157	     * carries at least one dot, with no whitespace anywhere. Deliberately permissive — it accepts
158	     * ordinary addresses while rejecting obvious non-addresses such as one lacking an {@code @}.
159	     */
